[00:00.22] Beddeɣ di tizi ssawleɣ
[00:07.88] Tiɣṛi-w teɛwej ur tban
[00:16.11] Ay anda llan wid akk ḥemmleɣ
[00:24.68] Ur fhimeɣ anida rran
[00:31.87] Lemmer zmireɣ ad ten-leḥqeɣ
[00:35.66] Lqid iyi-ṭṭfen ad as-qezzbeɣ
[00:38.95] Mi ten-ẓẓiɣ ɣer-s ad d-qqneɣ
[00:41.60] Uḥeqq bnadem ur nuksan
[00:47.85]
[01:26.67] Ussan la jeflen zerben
[01:30.02] Tazmart ccṛab iḥawec-itt
[01:33.03] Ceṭṛin uḥricen selken
[01:36.13] Nekkni taluf neḥrez-itt
[01:39.04] Nekna ur newwiḍ d imɣaren
[01:42.14] Tezgel-aɣ tmusni nezgel-itt
[01:45.13] Netteεcaq deg wayen ibaεden
[01:47.87] Ula d lweεd iskers-itt
[01:51.11]
[02:13.75] Ttmagareɣ ṭṭlam d widen
[02:16.96] D nekk i tɣunza tguni
[02:19.66] Mi nudmen akk yesɣaren
[02:22.86] Aman keččmen di tsusmi
[02:25.66] Lweqt nneɣ d imiren
[02:28.55] Nettak ttaεd i tziri
[02:31.49] I ṭṭer nettṛebbi ifadden
[02:34.43] Nettḥir ad aɣ-εezzin temẓi
[02:37.18]
[03:00.28] Widen mu tezwar ḍallen
[03:03.33] Akkin akka gren imɣi
[03:06.03] Wid yezgel yinig faqen
[03:09.20] I tugnit qedcen-d iɣfi
[03:11.95] Snuzun, qeṭṭun, ttaɣen
[03:14.97] Cerwen taluf seg iri
[03:17.79] Ur ksibeɣ ṛṛay kesben
[03:20.81] Thuzz-iyi deg urebbi-s tayri
[03:23.90]
[03:46.50] Mi as-nniɣ ad kem-kerheɣ
[03:49.67] Ad kem-ḍummmeɣ seg ul-iw
[03:52.46] Dɣa din i ttenteṛṛayeɣ
[03:55.63] Ssekraseɣ lecɣal-iw
[03:58.25] Ttewhimeɣ ayen ttaẓeɣ
[04:01.36] S ayen i smendagen ṭṭeṛ-iw
[04:04.36] Thedden ur d-ttensareɣ
[04:07.09] Tarṣiḍ tagust di leεmer-iw
[04:10.30]
[04:32.65] Ṛẓiɣ afrag i tmuɣli-w
[04:35.89] Ttḥiriɣ ad kem-ḍilleɣ
[04:38.60] Ḍarreɣ annar n wul-iw
[04:41.71] S yisem-im ad srewteɣ
[04:44.58] Ur hujreɣ si taddart-iw
[04:47.48] Akken kan ad kem-ẓeṛṛeɣ
[04:50.42] Sendeɣ ɣef imawlan-iw
[04:53.21] Mi sεan laεtiq ad txebḍeɣ
[04:56.01] Ur hujreɣ si taddart-iw
[04:58.79] Akken kan ad kem-ẓeṛṛeɣ
